# Server files are checked out on Linux and must keep LF endings regardless of
# the platform they were edited on. This is not cosmetic: a shell script with
# CRLF fails on Linux with "bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M", and systemd and cron
# are similarly unforgiving about the trailing carriage return.
#
# hrms/ has its own .gitattributes (Laravel's) which does not reach up here.
deploy/*            text eol=lf
deploy/deploy.sh    text eol=lf
*.sh                text eol=lf
*.service           text eol=lf
*.cron              text eol=lf

*.md   diff=markdown
*.html diff=html
